  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Air quality award-phase I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Luftmilj&#xf6;pris-Fas I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At the conference Swedish Asian Forum on Urban Environment held in Stockholm May 2000 it was decided that an Air Quality Improvement Award should be instituted. In this phase a consultant will survey different international environmental awards, propose organization for the award and specify terms of reference for consultant phase 2.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Vid konferensen &quot;Swedish- Asian Forum on Urban Environment&quot;, som h&#xf6;lls i Stockholm maj 2000,&quot;beslutades&quot; att ett luftmilj&#xf6;pris skulle instiftas f&#xf6;r en stad i Asien som gjort bra insatser p&#xe5; luftmilj&#xf6;omr&#xe5;det. I fas 1 skall konsulten ta reda p&#xe5; organisation f&#xf6;r befintliga milj&#xf6;pris,ge organisationsf&#xf6;rslag, skriva TOR f&#xf6;r fas 2.</narrative>
  </description>
